?><!doctype html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>QR Code | Loja BY</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js"></script></head><body><header class="top"><a class="brand" href="index.php"><span class="logo">BY</span><span>LOJA BY<small>SUA MARCA, SEU ESTILO</small></span></a><a href="index.php">Voltar à loja</a></header><main class="wrap"><div class="card center" style="max-width:650px;margin:35px auto"><h1>QR Code da Loja BY</h1><p>Depois de publicar a loja, cole abaixo o endereço público completo (começando com https://).</p><div class="field"><label>Link público da loja</label><input id="url" type="url" placeholder="https://seudominio.com.br" value=""></div><p><button class="btn" onclick="makeQR()">Gerar QR Code</button></p><div id="qrcode" style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:25px auto"></div><p id="hint" class="muted">O QR Code só será útil para clientes depois que o site estiver publicado na internet.</p><button class="btn outline" onclick="window.print()">Imprimir / salvar em PDF</button></div></main><script>function makeQR(){const u=document.getElementById('url').value.trim();if(!/^https?:\/\//i.test(u)){alert('Informe um link completo, começando com https://');return;}const el=document.getElementById('qrcode');el.innerHTML='';new QRCode(el,{text:u,width:220,height:220,colorDark:'#111111',colorLight:'#ffffff',correctLevel:QRCode.CorrectLevel.H});document.getElementById('hint').textContent='QR Code criado para: '+u;}</script></body></html>
